<%#
  Renders nothing. A layout or page that renders studio/board_assets keeps
  working; the render can be deleted.

  The board primitive's behaviour is the studio/board module. studio/alpine_shims
  publishes its factory as window.studioBoard on every page, before Alpine
  starts, so x-data="studioBoard({...})" on studio/board/_board resolves with no
  page-level script. The board controller (studio/controllers/board_controller,
  named by the board's own data-studio-controller) loads the vendored SortableJS
  on a page that renders a board.
%>
